<figure class="diagram-figure">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 360" role="img" aria-labelledby="scalar-diagram-title scalar-diagram-desc">
    <title id="scalar-diagram-title">Pengaruh perkalian skalar terhadap vektor</title>
    <desc id="scalar-diagram-desc">
      Vektor v diperpanjang menjadi dua kali lipat oleh skalar positif, dan dibalik arahnya oleh
      skalar negatif.
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <pattern id="scalar-grid" width="32" height="32" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <path d="M32 0H0V32" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-grid)" stroke-width="1" />
      </pattern>
      <marker id="scalar-arrow-v" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="var(--color-vector-a)" />
      </marker>
      <marker id="scalar-arrow-2v" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="var(--color-vector-result)" />
      </marker>
      <marker id="scalar-arrow-neg" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 10 5 0 10z" fill="var(--color-vector-b)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <rect width="640" height="360" fill="url(#scalar-grid)" rx="12" />
    <line x1="80" y1="300" x2="570" y2="300" stroke="var(--color-axis)" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <line x1="80" y1="300" x2="80" y2="55" stroke="var(--color-axis)" stroke-width="1.5" />

    <line x1="150" y1="290" x2="300" y2="190" stroke="var(--color-vector-a)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#scalar-arrow-v)" />
    <line x1="150" y1="290" x2="450" y2="90" stroke="var(--color-vector-result)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#scalar-arrow-2v)" />
    <line x1="150" y1="290" x2="75" y2="340" stroke="var(--color-vector-b)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#scalar-arrow-neg)" />

    <circle cx="150" cy="290" r="4.5" fill="var(--color-primary)" />
    <text x="235" y="186" class="diagram-label diagram-label--a">v</text>
    <text x="462" y="86" class="diagram-label diagram-label--result">2v</text>
    <text x="20" y="352" class="diagram-label diagram-label--b">−0,5v</text>
    <text x="132" y="312" class="diagram-axis">O</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Skalar positif memperpanjang atau memendekkan vektor tanpa membalik arah. Skalar negatif
    membalik arah dan mengubah panjang sesuai nilai absolutnya.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
